# Windows W3a: the actual Cambium CSD window must fill the monitor work area
# without painting under the taskbar or spilling past another monitor edge.
# `scripts/windows-maximized-receipt.ps1` observes the same HWND while this
# scenario remains maximized, then creates HOST_SMOKE_RELEASE_FILE.

log W3a: opened the restored Cambium window
assert snap maximized == false
capture restored

click role:button Maximize
settle 4
assert snap maximized == true
capture maximized

await-release
wait 600
assert snap maximized == true

click role:button Maximize
settle 4
assert snap maximized == false
capture restored-again
log W3a: maximized client rect matched the Windows work area and restored
